id: pm-todos-zpyc
title: Certify pm-todos on PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.4 and consolidate pending dependency updates
description: "Certify the published PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.4 with exact latest development tools, canonical pm-ops launcher, Dependabot CodeQL consolidation, strict health, full release gate, packed acceptance and real tracker npm/native-Bun dogfood. Preserve minimum host 2026.8.20, existing coverage thresholds and disabled GitHub issue-sync boundary."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[3]: agent-ux,"area:github","area:release"
created_at: "2026-09-27T08:15:15.176Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T12:54:57.347Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "Package and lock pins updated to published CLI, pm-ops and pm-changelog 2026.10.4; managed pm-github source exact 2026.10.4; canonical launcher and real broken-install child tests pass; strict health and full release gate pass; sync stays disabled pending privacy gate; exact-head CI and review complete."
repro_steps: "On main, run pm health --strict-exit --json under host CLI 2026.9.27 and observe extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew; inspect CI and sync workflow unversioned extension installs. After updating pm-ops, the existing canonical launcher byte-identity test fails until its published template is copied."
expected_result: "Pinned 2026.10.4 tooling passes existing gates, health, packed consumers and read-only GitHub preview; PR stays open for orchestrator review/merge."
actual_result: "Final locked release:check PASS 285/285 zero skips; unchanged index.ts L/B/F 97.87/93.33/98.46, no separately measured statements. Canonical reader, production audit, pack, four current/minimum npm/Bun scenarios, changelog/date/attestation pass. Both audits clean; strict health pass. Greptile malformed lookup regression red/green verified. CodeRabbit Windows pack regression 3 failures before/4 passes after shell-free Node npm launcher and literal argv check; native Windows not measured. Both linked heavy commands create the required lock parent. Real tracker npm/native-Bun 83-item round-trip and GitHub preview 0/2/0 pass. Remaining review quotas/absent bots do not establish approval; final remote checks follow."
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
