comments[15]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T06:20:10.124Z",claude-hub,"2026-09-28: pinned pm-ops 2026.9.28 and re-copied its templates/prepare-merge-driver.ts (pm-ops#124: the omit-dev skip now checks every Node resolution path for an incomplete hoisted pm-ops, so a broken ancestor install fails instead of silently skipping the merge drivers). release:check and changelog:check pass on this branch."
  "2026-10-02T22:10:28.268Z",codex-sol,"Restart by codex-sol: preserved remote PR #103 and all existing bot replies/reactions were inspected. Branch is already current with origin/main. No new actionable unresolved inline finding is present. Retain documented coverage/health/publication blockers; rerun unchanged full CI gate with the host-wide flock. No merge, publish or item closure."
  "2026-10-02T22:36:28.489Z",codex-sol,"Restart: reproduced CI exact project-local npm:pm-github@2026.9.26 installation and verified package version; restored the tracked managed registry exactly as CI does. Locked npm ci and unchanged release:check pass 280/280 tests, zero skips, measured index.ts 97.87% lines / 93.33% branches / 98.46% functions; statements are not separately reported. Canonical-reader, production audit, packed npm/Bun current/minimum host acceptance, changelog/date/attestation gates pass. The linked prepare suite initially refused foreign-ref trust; acknowledged authorized commands and reran successfully. Published canonical-template identity continues to cover ancestor-install handling. Coverage pm-todos-p60g and fail-closed pre-push privacy prerequisites remain open; issue-sync workflow stays disabled. No merge, publish or close; release claim for orchestrator."
  "2026-10-02T22:48:37.309Z",codex-sol,"Valid CodeRabbit/Cubic tracking correction: the #124 link note was stale, not a current publication blocker. Updated only the current doc-link note to identify pinned published pm-ops 2026.9.28; preserved every dated comment/note/history line. Full gate at 309a379 passed 280/280 plus canonical reader and packed npm/Bun. Coverage and pre-push privacy blockers remain."
  "2026-10-04T10:50:21.519Z",codex-sol,"2026-10-04 codex-sol: isolated certification worktree from origin/main 64552c7. Reuse this certification item, consolidate Dependabot #104 CodeQL SHA, exact latest dev pins, preserve minimum host 2026.8.20 and existing coverage thresholds; no open Dependabot alerts. Scheduled issue sync remains disabled. Orchestrator owns merge and closure."
  "2026-10-04T10:54:06.854Z",codex-sol,"Exact dependencies installed: CLI/SDK, pm-ops, pm-changelog 2026.10.4; @types/node 26.6.4; TypeScript 7.0.2. Both npm audit --omit=dev and npm audit report zero vulnerabilities. Existing canonical byte-identity regression failed before copying the published pm-ops template, then node --test test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts passed 7/7, zero skips. Shared host lock serializes extension restore and release acceptance."
  "2026-10-04T11:01:06.457Z",codex-sol,"Full gate failed test-first: CLI 2026.10.4 correctly refuses incomplete 10,000-entry local checkout installs (extension_install_incomplete_source_scan) in coverage-commands, import-close-reason and rich JSONL integration fixtures. Replace checkout scanning with npm pack --ignore-scripts distribution artifacts and canonical package install; preserve all original behavior/doctor assertions and coverage thresholds. No upstream defect: this is the intended fail-closed installer behavior."
  "2026-10-04T11:10:07.880Z",codex-sol,"Real tracker packed dogfood passed under npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 and bunx --bun @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4: version=2026.10.4; --json todos export --format jsonl --output <scratch>/real-<launcher>.jsonl exported all 83 parseable rows; --json todos import <file> --format jsonl --upsert --dry-run proposed 0 imports/83 updates/0 skips; actual upsert reported 0 imports/83 updates/0 skips. Only scratch copies were mutated and the scratch root was deleted. Exact command suffixes and receipts are in docs/certification-2026.10.4.md."
  "2026-10-04T11:16:49.942Z",codex-sol,"Second full gate: 280/280 tests, zero skips; index.ts 97.87% lines/93.33% branches/98.46% functions, canonical-reader and audit pass. Packed acceptance failed test-first because pm test exports PM_PATH for its tracker sandbox and accept-packed inherited it into independent scenarios. Scope PM_PATH explicitly to each scenario-local .agents/pm so no ambient tracker can be reinitialized; preserve all four current/minimum npm/Bun scenarios and exact assertions."
  "2026-10-04T11:36:06.433Z",codex-sol,"Final full gate passed via npx pm test pm-todos-zpyc --run --only-index 3 --progress --pm-context tracker --override-linked-pm-context; linked command is flock /tmp/claude-1000/heavy-gate.lock npm run release:check. 280/280 tests, zero skips; 97.87/93.33/98.46 measured line/branch/function coverage; four packed current/minimum npm/Bun scenarios pass. Releasing claim for orchestrator; item stays in_progress and open for review/merge verification."
  "2026-10-04T12:25:02.506Z",codex-sol,"Greptile PR #106 identified the missing malformed-lookup regression for the canonical launcher. Added a child-process fixture with node_modules as a file: it fails against origin/main launcher with ENOTDIR, and passes with the unchanged pm-ops 2026.10.4 template while requiring MODULE_NOT_FOUND and no omit-dev notice. Scoped launcher suite and lint pass. Initial remote Node 22.18/26 and CodeQL passed; CodeRabbit auto-review skipped, Sourcery quota exhausted, other requested reviews remain missing."
  "2026-10-04T12:25:36.420Z",codex-sol,"Correction to the preceding note: the scoped launcher suite passed 8/8, zero skips. This repository has no ESLint dependency or lint script; the attempted direct eslint invocation was unavailable. The actual repository check is TypeScript typecheck, now exercised by the full linked release gate. No lint outcome is claimed."
  "2026-10-04T12:31:29.975Z",codex-sol,"Review follow-up full locked release gate PASS 281/281 tests, zero skipped; unchanged configured L/B/F coverage 97.87/93.33/98.46 and no separate statements metric. The new malformed lookup test fails old launcher with ENOTDIR and passes the unchanged published template. Updated stale managed-extension acceptance version to 2026.10.4 and create shared-lock parent in linked gate, preserving mandatory lock and release body. Both audits, native canonical reader, all four current/minimum npm/Bun packed scenarios and release checks pass. Sourcery weekly and Cubic monthly quota notices are missing review evidence; manual remaining reviews follow after push."
  "2026-10-04T12:49:42.156Z",codex-sol,"CodeRabbit #106 valid Windows pack finding reproduced test-first: 3 Windows invocation regressions fail before the fix while POSIX passes. Invoke npm JavaScript entrypoint through process.execPath on Windows with shell=false, preserving literal spaced destination and ampersand/percent arguments; fallback entrypoint beside Node covered. Real Node subprocess preserves arguments. All four new tests pass. Also create mandatory lock parent before the separate packed linked test. Full gate follows; native Windows execution is not claimed."
  "2026-10-04T12:54:55.040Z",codex-sol,"Final Windows review-fix full PM-linked gate PASS 285/285 tests, zero skips, unchanged measured L/B/F 97.87/93.33/98.46 across index.ts and no statement metric. Exact runner npx pm test pm-todos-zpyc --run --only-index 3 --progress --pm-context tracker --override-linked-pm-context executes mkdir -p /tmp/claude-1000 && flock /tmp/claude-1000/heavy-gate.lock npm run release:check. Canonical reader, audits, pack, all four current/minimum npm/Bun scenarios and release checks pass. Portable Windows plan/real Node argv regressions pass 4/4; native Windows execution remains outside measured evidence. Both linked heavy tests create the lock parent; release claim without closure."
notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-27T08:17:04.004Z",codex,"2026-09-27: Published CLI/SDK 2026.9.27 and pm-github 2026.9.26 installed through the project-local CLI; strict health passes with stale-item advisories. The published pm-ops launcher byte-identity test failed before copying its 2026.9.26 template, then the focused child-checkout suite passed 7/7 including incomplete directory and dangling link. Following a valid CodeRabbit privacy finding on the sibling pm-jira candidate, the checked-in scheduled sync job now has an if: false guard in addition to GitHub disabled_manually. The separate pre-push privacy gate is still absent; sync must not be enabled."
  "2026-09-27T08:27:21.211Z",codex,"2026-09-27 final guarded candidate: npm run release:check exits 0 after sync job if: false and PM link updates. 280/280 source tests pass with zero skips; index.ts honestly measures 97.87% lines, 93.33% branches, and 98.46% functions, with no statement metric. Docstring gate documents 81/81 declarations; zero production npm audit findings. Packed npm-current and bun-current against CLI/SDK 2026.9.27 and npm-minimum and bun-minimum against 2026.8.20 each imported 1 and exported 2 real fixture rows. The separate coverage item pm-todos-p60g remains open; the checked-in and GitHub scheduled sync are inert pending a fail-closed pre-push privacy gate. Exact-head CI and bot review remain to be completed after push."
  "2026-09-27T08:35:54.168Z",codex,"2026-09-27 exact-head Greptile P1 is valid: an incomplete ancestor node_modules/pm-ops can be treated as omit-dev by the published pm-ops 2026.9.26 launcher. The canonical source issue ops-jzp5 in unmerged pm-ops #124 already scans ancestor resolution paths and tests a real hoisted incomplete install. Keep this consumer PR open until the reviewed source is published, update the pin and byte-identical template, rerun full release and packed npm/Bun acceptance, and request a fresh exact-head review. CodeRabbit reported no actionable issue, but Greptile check fails on this head."
